9
00:00:10,739 --> 00:00:11,425
Max.

10
00:00:12,125 --> 00:00:12,688
You looked!

11
00:00:12,988 --> 00:00:14,162
I watched the pen.

12
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:15,097
Not the paper.

13
00:00:15,497 --> 00:00:16,262
The top of a

14
00:00:16,262 --> 00:00:17,309
pen moves more than

15
00:00:17,309 --> 00:00:18,674
the tip. Every capital

16
00:00:18,674 --> 00:00:19,580
